From 3ec378115d20b2907884bf7f1b2ca9b3c926c51a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 08:24:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] lax/polyregular-functions: proofs build at v4.33.0
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

One enum Fintype via derive_fintype%, convert-using-1 on IsRegular via
isRegular_of_eq, an ite at a Language position rewritten through
'show … from if_pos h' instead of split, simpa replaced by exact where
Language membership is defeq, and the ForTest.Holds sites: keeping Holds
folded in simp only so if_pos/if_neg synthesize the same Decidable
instance (the condition proofs given their folded type in a have). No
statement changed; concepts untouched.
